WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.520
Hi, and welcome!

2
00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:07.805
I'd love to show you Codexta: an AI assistant you can actually put in front of your customers.

3
00:00:07.805 --> 00:00:09.610
It follows your procedures,

4
00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:14.290
and it checks with the right person before anything important happens.

5
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.510
You keep your systems, add your processes in plain language,

6
00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:22.100
and stay in control.

7
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.956
Here's a banking example.

8
00:00:24.956 --> 00:00:29.001
Our head of lending hands Codexta her operations manual.

9
00:00:29.001 --> 00:00:31.385
Because she has authoring rights,

10
00:00:31.385 --> 00:00:34.852
it becomes a working capability: actions, forms,

11
00:00:34.852 --> 00:00:36.514
screens and a workflow.

12
00:00:36.514 --> 00:00:39.620
All tested, and live only when she says so.

13
00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:45.580
And the manual becomes a workflow the platform enforces.

14
00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:52.360
Ana applies for a ten-thousand-euro car loan, in her own words.

15
00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:55.922
Codexta checks her documents itself.

16
00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.574
It spots that her ID card has expired,

17
00:00:58.574 --> 00:01:00.459
and asks her for a new one,

18
00:01:00.459 --> 00:01:03.390
before a loan officer even opens the file.

19
00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:08.779
For the risk analyst, Codexta does the due diligence: income,

20
00:01:08.779 --> 00:01:12.833
credit registry and affordability, summed up in one view.

21
00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:15.180
She simply approves, or declines.

22
00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:17.657
Ana sees her offer.

23
00:01:17.657 --> 00:01:19.160
Never the internals.

24
00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:24.148
And the same agent connects to your core banking system.

25
00:01:24.148 --> 00:01:26.399
Accounts, insights and payments,

26
00:01:26.399 --> 00:01:28.860
all behind the bank's own controls.

27
00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:31.079
That's Codexta.

28
00:01:31.079 --> 00:01:35.911
Your processes, carried out by AI, with the controls built in.

29
00:01:35.911 --> 00:01:37.470
Thanks for watching!

